# HumaScale stack rule

- Canonical backend: `Backend/Backend` (Laravel 13 + Sanctum).
- Canonical frontend: `Frontend/humascale-frontend` (React + Vite).
- Never implement features against Express / `humascale-full (2)` / `artifacts/api-server`.
- Read `PROJECT_CONTEXT.md` before large changes.
- Official readiness: score &lt; 50 → low, &lt; 70 → medium, else good.
- AI must not change scores, readiness, weak pillars, phases, or KPIs.
- This phase: Backend + docs only unless the user explicitly asks for React changes.
- Frontend work instructions live in `docs/frontend-implementation-guide.md`.
